// The points-to stage, bounded: what Argus.Analysis.Extraction runs when
// the exact stage (points_to.dl) does not finish in time. The same
// program, with the leaves a coarse pass finds pervasive resolved by that
// pass (clientlib/pervasive.dl); it writes the same relations, and which
// leaves it resolved so, for the caller to report.

.include "points_to.dl"

stage_mode("bounded").

.output pervasive(filename="pervasive.csv")
